                <pb facs="0907" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./57:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Geissler</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-18T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 18,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>36. Department’s 21, March 16, 5 p.m. Pan American Airways report MacGregor
                    having difficulties in his negotiations. Report briefly by cable, fully by mail
                    present situation and render all possible assistance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
